Multiple key=value pairs in one call are applied together, in the order given;
the summary lists each pair.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=in-progress type=feature
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
-status: backlog
+status: in-progress
+type: feature
 ---
 # Body
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=in-progress, type=feature
